      "level": "H3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Expose students to potential career opportunities in the field.",
      "level": "H3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Encourage students to pursue higher education and major in",
      "level": "H3"
    },
    {
      "text": "STEM careers.",
